    <string name="ciberseguridad_disclaimer_short">Only use these tools against systems you own or have explicit authorization for — misuse can be illegal.</string>
    <string name="ciberseguridad_disclaimer_full">Cybersecurity installs and gives access to real pentesting/OSINT tools (nmap, theHarvester, nikto, dirb, sqlmap and, at the Pro tier, a full Kali Linux container).\n\nUsing these tools against networks, systems, domains, or accounts that are not yours, or without explicit and verifiable authorization from the owner, may constitute a crime under the laws of your country (for example, unauthorized access to computer systems or data interception).\n\nKairos does not and cannot verify that you have that authorization — you are the one who takes on all legal and ethical responsibility for every action you run with these tools, whether inside or outside the full terminal this module exposes.</string>

